<title>USA: ONBANCorp Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>ONBANCorp Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Income Statement ($ in thousands)</p>
<p>						  Three Months</p>
<p>						  Ended Dec. 31,</p>
<p>						  1996	     1995</p>
<p> Interest income			  95,736	  109,368</p>
<p> Interest expense			 56,656	   70,629</p>
<p> Net interest income		    39,080	   38,739</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses	     1,963	    1,800</p>
