<p>Fully diluted before certain</p>
<p>    one-time items			  3.20	     2.75</p>
<p>NOTE: Current earnings include one-time deposit insurance assessment of $7.282 million before tax. They are adjusted to exclude the after-tax effect of $4.52 million assessment, a $1.9 million tax liability, and a $1.3 million gain on securities transactions.</p>
<p>The company said it had total assets of $5.42 billion.</p>
